      "examples": "idp.telos.host/1.3.0/examples.json",
      "producer": {
        "repository": "idp-host",
        "path": "api/contracts",
        "consistency_test": "go test ./internal/run -run TestContract",
        "regenerate_examples": "go test ./internal/run -run TestContract -update"
      },
      "note": "Agent Hosting & Coordination（idp-host）的 AgentRelease（idp.host.agent/v1，可嵌入 Skill、引用子 agent）、SkillRelease（idp.host.skill/v1，可带资源）、Envelope、AgentRun（含子 agent 运行）与 RunOptions（创建运行时的调用方选项）。权威副本在 idp-host/api/contracts/，这里的副本必须逐字节相同（tools/validate.py 核对）。",
